B.a9R=s(["Sign up and choose 'Mechanic'.","Fill in your profile: name, experience, services, whether you are mobile or work from a shop, and your warranty if you offer one.","Add your base address (see 'Your base address and how matching works').","Upload any ASE certificates and proof of insurance you have. These are optional but show as badges that help customers choose you.","Set up Stripe so you can be paid (see 'Getting paid: Stripe setup').","Read and sign the Mechanic Agreement."],t.s)
B.a0E=new A.ht(B.a9R)
B.a_K=new A.b_("You can bid once YCYC has reviewed and verified your profile. Shops show 'awaiting verification' until that happens.")
B.a6H=s([B.a0E,B.a_K],t.f)
B.Yw=new A.bc("m-start-setup","Setting up your mechanic profile","Sign up, fill in your profile, and get verified.",B.a6H)
B.a_z=new A.b_("YCYC asks where you work from so it can match you with customers near you. When a customer posts a job, the app sends it to mechanics whose base address is within about 100 miles of the job.")
B.a9Z=s(["Your base address is used only for matching. Customers do not see it.","Update it in your profile whenever you move your base.","If you have not saved a base address, you will see a reminder and you may see all open jobs instead of just nearby ones. You may also miss new-job notifications, so please add it."],t.s)
B.YP=new A.dA(B.a9Z)
B.a8P=s([B.a_z,B.YP],t.f)
B.Ya=new A.bc("m-start-base","Your base address and how matching works","Why we ask for it, and who sees it.",B.a8P)
B.a0e=new A.b_("Payouts go through Stripe. From your dashboard, tap to set up payouts and follow Stripe's steps. Stripe asks for identity and bank details directly. YCYC never sees your bank or card numbers.")
B.a_3=new A.b_("Until Stripe finishes verifying you, you may not be able to be paid. Check your earnings screen for any item Stripe still needs.")
B.ZP=new A.e1("If Stripe asks for more information later, complete it promptly. Payouts can pause until you do.")
B.a7V=s([B.a0e,B.a_3,B.ZP],t.f)
B.Xk=new A.bc("m-start-stripe","Getting paid: Stripe setup","Connect a bank account or debit card through Stripe.",B.a7V)
B.a_q=new A.b_("Upload ASE certificates and proof of insurance in your profile. YCYC reviews them. Approved ones show as badges on your profile and bids.")
B.aa4=s(["Only upload documents that are yours and current.","An insurance badge may disappear when the policy expires. Re-upload the new one.","Never fake or alter a document. It is grounds for permanent removal."],t.s)
B.YR=new A.dA(B.aa4)
B.abw=s([B.a_q,B.YR],t.f)
B.XH=new A.bc("m-start-badges","Certifications, insurance and your profile badges","Help customers trust you with real documents.",B.abw)
B.a0c=new A.b_("Open jobs near you appear on your Jobs tab. When a new job is posted near you, you get a notification ('New job near you', or 'New diagnostic request near you'). Tap it to go straight to the job.")
B.a_s=new A.b_("Each job shows the vehicle, the problem description, photos, the zip code, and any flags (see 'Flags & labels' for what they all mean).")
B.Zp=new A.e1("The customer's full address is not shown while you are bidding.")
B.aa7=s([B.a0c,B.a_s,B.Zp],t.f)
B.Xm=new A.bc("m-start-find","Finding jobs","The Jobs tab, notifications, and filters.",B.aa7)
B.abJ=s(["Open the job and read it carefully, including the flags and photos.","Tap to bid, enter your price and when you can arrive.","Add a note: what is included, parts or no parts, and anything the customer should know.","Submit. You can see your bid on your Bids tab."],t.s)
B.a0D=new A.ht(B.abJ)
B.a_g=new A.b_("Read 'Bidding rules' before bidding. Honest, complete bids win repeat customers and protect your account.")
B.a7J=s([B.a0D,B.a_g],t.f)
B.Yc=new A.bc("m-start-bid","Submitting a bid","Price, arrival time, and a short note.",B.a7J)
B.a_W=new A.b_("When a customer accepts your bid and pays, their card is held. The job moves to 'In progress'. The customer's full address is then shown to you, along with the arrival time.")
B.a_P=new A.b_("The money is not paid out yet. It is released after the customer confirms the work is complete, or when YCYC releases it as the agreement describes.")
B.acg=s([B.a_W,B.a_P],t.f)
B.XZ=new A.bc("m-start-won","After your bid is accepted","The customer pays into a hold. Then you do the work.",B.acg)
B.acC=s(["Tap 'Heading to customer' when you set off, or 'Heading to parts store' if you are collecting parts first.","Tap 'I've arrived' (it checks your location) when you reach the address. The app records your location to check you are really there.","Ask the customer to confirm arrival and start of work, then tap 'Confirm arrived & started work' on your side too.","Do the work and send updates and photos in the app."],t.s)
B.a0C=new A.ht(B.acC)
B.a14=new A.hR("You must have a verified arrival before you can cancel for a customer-fault reason such as a no-show or wrong parts.")
B.ZA=new A.e1("Fees for rescheduling and cancelling depend on these check-ins. Check in honestly and on time.")
B.a8m=s([B.a0C,B.a14,B.ZA],t.f)
B.XM=new A.bc("m-start-checkin","Heading to the customer, arriving, and location check-ins","These records protect you and the customer.",B.a8m)
B.a_7=new A.b_("If you find something else that needs doing, tap 'Propose additional work' in the app with a description, a price and optionally photos. The customer approves or declines. Never start extra work, or ask for extra money, before approval.")
B.Zw=new A.e1("You cannot add work to a diagnostic job. Hours and price are final once the diagnostic is accepted.")
B.abG=s([B.a_7,B.Zw],t.f)
B.Xh=new A.bc("m-start-extra","Requesting additional work","Found something else? Ask in the app.",B.abG)
B.a_8=new A.b_("On a diagnostic job you bid a number of hours and your hourly rate. The customer sees the hours, the rate and the total. Once accepted, they are final.")
B.a9E=s(["You must send a written diagnosis in the app ('Write & send diagnosis'): what you found, what you recommend, and whether the car is safe to drive.","Payment is released after you send it and the customer confirms you finished diagnosing.","If you cannot find the problem, say so honestly in the diagnosis.","Any repair the diagnosis suggests is a new job the customer can give to anyone."],t.s)
B.YS=new A.dA(B.a9E)
B.a8O=s([B.a_8,B.YS],t.f)
B.XU=new A.bc("m-start-diag","Diagnostic jobs","Bid hours and rate. Send a written diagnosis to be paid.",B.a8O)
B.acG=s(["Finish the work and tell the customer what was done.","Tap 'Work completed' in the app, and add notes and photos.","The customer reviews and releases payment. You are notified.","The customer may leave a review. Good work and clear communication earn good reviews."],t.s)
B.a0x=new A.ht(B.acG)
B.ace=s([B.a0x],t.f)
B.Ys=new A.bc("m-start-finish","Finishing the job and getting reviewed","Mark complete; the customer confirms; you are paid.",B.ace)
B.a9g=s([B.Yw,B.Ya,B.Xk,B.XH,B.Xm,B.Yc,B.XZ,B.XM,B.Xh,B.XU,B.Ys],t.fm)
B.a0L=new A.hf("How to use the app","Set up, find jobs, bid, work, and get paid",B.za,B.a9g)
B.a2q=new A.ad(62251,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.a15=new A.hR("Submitting a fraudulently low price is not allowed. It is grounds for removal.")
B.a_J=new A.b_("A bid is a promise. Bid the real price you will do the job for, including everything you expect the job to need.")
B.a_I=new A.b_("Not allowed:")
B.a7N=s(["A price you do not intend to honor, to win the job and then raise it after arrival.","Bait-and-switch: a low bid followed by demands for more money, or refusing the agreed work unless the customer pays more.","Leaving out what you know the job needs, then adding it later outside the approval flow.","Bidding on a job you cannot or do not intend to do.","Bidding on a labor-only job and then requiring the customer to buy parts from you, or the reverse.","Asking the customer to pay cash, or to pay anywhere outside YCYC."],t.s)
B.YU=new A.dA(B.a7N)
B.ZU=new A.b_("What you can do: if the job turns out to need more than expected, send an additional work request in the app and let the customer decide. If it is far outside what was posted, it is fine to explain and let the customer cancel.")
B.Zs=new A.e1("Repeated complaints, cancelled jobs after low bids, or customers reporting a price change can lead to your account being reviewed, payouts held, suspension or permanent removal.")
B.a9_=s([B.a15,B.a_J,B.a_I,B.YU,B.ZU,B.Zs],t.f)
B.XG=new A.bc("m-bidding-honest","Honest bidding: no fraudulent or bait prices","Bid what you will actually do the job for.",B.a9_)
B.a0_=new A.b_("If the customer switched on 'I have my own parts', the job carries a bold orange flag: LABOR QUOTE ONLY, CUSTOMER SUPPLYING PARTS. Bid labor only. Do not include parts in the price and do not bring parts.")
B.abU=s(["Ask the customer for the part numbers if you want to check them before you go.","On arrival, check the parts are the right ones and are ready.","If the parts are wrong, take a clear photo of the part, then you can cancel for customer fault (a note of at least 10 characters is required). You receive 20% of the job price, shared as described in 'How payouts work'.","If the parts are not ready or nobody is there after you have waited 10 minutes, you can cancel the same way."],t.s)
B.YH=new A.dA(B.abU)
B.a19=new A.hR("Only cancel for these reasons if they are true. You must have a verified arrival, and the photo and note are kept as evidence.")
B.a8J=s([B.a0_,B.YH,B.a19],t.f)
B.Xo=new A.bc("m-bidding-laboronly","Labor-only jobs: how to bid","The customer supplies the parts. Quote labor only.",B.a8J)
B.ZS=new A.b_("Bid the realistic hours the diagnosis takes and your honest hourly rate. Once accepted, the hours and price are fixed. You cannot add time later.")
B.a0h=new A.b_("Be clear in your note about what is included, for example scan, inspection or test drive.")
B.acz=s([B.ZS,B.a0h],t.f)
B.Y4=new A.bc("m-bidding-diag","Bidding on diagnostics","Hours x rate. No add-ons.",B.acz)
B.a_x=new A.b_("All payments for jobs found on YCYC must go through YCYC. Do not accept or ask for cash, transfers or payment apps for a job that came from the platform, and do not take the customer off the platform to avoid fees.")
B.a__=new A.b_("This protects both of you: it keeps a record, and it keeps your payment secured. Breaking this rule can lead to removal and held payouts.")
B.aan=s([B.a_x,B.a__],t.f)
B.Y2=new A.bc("m-bidding-offapp","Keep everything on YCYC","No cash, no side deals.",B.aan)
B.abX=s(["Bid only on work you are qualified and equipped to do safely.","Check that you can make the arrival time you promise.","You are responsible for any licenses, permits and insurance your work needs.","If you cannot do the job after all, tell the customer and cancel early, before they are inconvenienced."],t.s)
