B.a0U=new A.hf("Bidding rules","Honest bids only",B.a2q,B.a8s)
B.aab=s(["Clear description: a good job lists symptoms, when it started and what has been tried. Photos help.","Matches your skills, tools and parts access.","Distance and timing make sense. Check the zip code and travel time.","Price is realistic. You can do it safely and still earn a fair rate after YCYC's 15% fee.","Check the flags: Labor quote only, diagnostic needed, Dealer quote, and so on.","Does the vehicle look suitable for a mobile job? Heavy work may need a shop."],t.s)
