B.a9U=s(["Re-check the address on the job.","Check the address and any notes on the job again. The app has no chat or calling, so you cannot message the customer from inside it.","Tap 'I've arrived' once you are at the location so it is recorded.","Wait. If nobody comes, follow 'The customer is not there'."],t.s)
