B.abu=s([B.a0z,B.Zu,B.a_Z],t.f)
B.Xl=new A.bc("c-start-post","Posting a job","Vehicle, address, what is wrong, and photos.",B.abu)
B.a_L=new A.b_("If you do not know what is wrong, post a diagnostic request instead of a repair. Mechanics bid a number of hours and their hourly rate, and you see the hours, the rate and the total.")
B.ab5=s(["Once you accept, the hours and price are final. The mechanic cannot add time or charges.","The mechanic must send you a written diagnosis through the app: what they found, what they recommend, and whether the car can be driven.","Payment is released only after the diagnosis is sent and you confirm in the app that the mechanic finished diagnosing.","If the mechanic does not find the problem or does not send the written diagnosis, they are not entitled to payment and YCYC may refund you in full."],t.s)
B.YD=new A.dA(B.ab5)
B.ZI=new A.e1("Any repair the diagnosis recommends is a separate job. You can hire any mechanic for it, including the one who diagnosed it, or none.")
