B.Ye=new A.bc("c-start-diagnostic","Not sure what is wrong? Ask for a diagnostic","Pay a mechanic to find the problem first, then decide on the repair.",B.aat)
B.a0k=new A.b_("Bids appear on your job as mechanics send them. Only you can see them; mechanics cannot see each other's prices.")
B.a_1=new A.b_("Tap a mechanic's card to open their profile: reviews, years of experience, certifications, whether they carry insurance, mobile or shop, warranty, and more.")
B.a_F=new A.b_("There is no rush. A low price is not the only thing that matters. See 'Choosing a mechanic' for tips.")
B.a9b=s([B.a0k,B.a_1,B.a_F],t.f)
B.Y1=new A.bc("c-start-bids","Reading and comparing bids","Price, arrival time, and the mechanic profile.",B.a9b)
